妈妈：{0100:0}，喜欢你的新
房间吗？{be01}
太好了！房间收拾得
很整洁呢！{be01}
楼下的行李也都整理
完毕了。{be01}
宝可梦搬家服务真方
便啊！{be01}
对了，记得检查一下
你桌子上的东西是不
是都齐了。

Hey!
You...{be01}
Who are you?{be01}
Oh, you’re {0100:0}, aren’t you?
Moved in next door, right?{be01}
I didn’t know that you’re a girl.{be01}
Dad, Prof. Birch, said that our new
next-door neighbor is a Gym Leader’s{be00}
kid, so I assumed you’d be a guy.{be01}
My name’s Brendan.
So, hi, neighbor!{be01}
Huh? Hey, {0100:0}, don’t you have
a Pokémon?{be01}
Do you want me to go catch you one?{be01}
Aw, darn, I forgot...{be01}
I’m supposed to go help my dad catch
some wild Pokémon.{be01}
Some other time, okay?

小悠：嗨，{0100:0}，{be01}
我在检查我的宝可梦
图鉴。{be01}
我还有不少宝可梦要
捕捉，但现在这样{be00}
进展也不错。{be01}
看着这宝可梦图鉴就
觉得它好像在催我回
草丛里去。
